{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15949","headline":"壠头水 · 王建","name":"壠头水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壠水何年壠头别，不在山中亦呜咽。\n征人塞耳马不行，未到壠头闻水声。\n谓是西流入蒲海，还闻北去绕龙城。\n壠东壠西多屈曲，野麋饮水长簇簇。\n胡兵夜回水旁住，忆着来时磨劒处。\n向前无井复无泉，放马回看壠头树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}